NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the code in this repository only.

It does NOT cover, and this repository does not redistribute:

  * The FlyWire FAFB v783 connectome (Dorkenwald et al.; Schlegel et al.).
    Downloaded at runtime by m3_neurons.py and setup/06-clone-flybrain.sh.
    Subject to FlyWire's own terms and citation requirements.

  * The leaky integrate-and-fire brain model of Shiu et al., Nature
    634:210-219 (2024), and the eonsystemspbc/fly-brain implementation it is
    used through. Subject to their respective licences.

  * FlyGym / NeuroMechFly (NeLy-EPFL), installed via pip. Subject to its own
    licence.

If you use this work, cite the upstream sources, not just this repository.
